      "MsgSerial" : 207063,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's dreadful—what fate has befallen \r\nthe brethren who were summoned \r\nto the northern city right before \r\nthe golden dragon appeared?",
        "Jp" : "恐ろしい――\r\n金色の竜が現れる少し前、北の都に\r\n招待された同胞達はどうなってしまった\r\nというのだろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 214392,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Why is there no news at all? \r\nAnd that dragon—the chill I felt \r\nwhen I saw the golden shadow \r\nflying through the sky—",
        "Jp" : "なぜ、こうも便りがない？\r\nそしてあの竜――空を舞う黄金の影を\r\n見た時に感じた悪寒――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 214395,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Why, I can't stop shaking even now.\r\nIt's like ice deep in my heart...",
        "Jp" : "なぜだ、今も震えが止まらない\r\n心臓の奥が凍りつくような――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 214398,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The few of us left in Erte Deenan must join \r\nforces and protect this place \r\nuntil everyone returns...",
        "Jp" : "エルテ・ディナンに残った僅かな者で\r\n力を合わせ、皆が戻るまでここを守らねば――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 214401,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
